; Sheet's strings, in English: the program is built with these, and a
; translation in LOCALE:Catalogs/<language>/programs/Sheet.catalog
; stands in for them. A requester's and the status line's texts are
; written by RawDoFmt, which takes their values in order: a translation
; keeps them so. A formula's function names, TRUE and FALSE are the
; formulas' own and stay as they are.
#version 1
;
; The menus.
MSG_MENU_PROJECT (1//)
Project
MSG_MENU_NEW (//)
New
