;
; What the status line says. A formula's problem goes into MSG_PROBLEM_AT
; with where it was found.
MSG_PROBLEM_NAME (//)
No such function or name
MSG_PROBLEM_ARGUMENTS (//)
Wrong number of arguments
MSG_PROBLEM_PARENTHESES (//)
A parenthesis has no partner
MSG_PROBLEM_TOO_LONG (//)
The formula is too long
MSG_PROBLEM_UNREADABLE (//)
The formula cannot be read
MSG_PROBLEM_AT (//)
%s, at character %u
MSG_NO_MEMORY_KEEP (//)
Not enough memory to keep all of that
MSG_NO_MEMORY_FILE (//)
Not enough memory for all of the file
MSG_LEFT_OUT (//)
Cells past row 9999 or column IV were left out
MSG_NO_MEMORY_COPY (//)
No memory to copy that much
MSG_NO_MEMORY_CLEAR (//)
Not enough memory to clear all of it
MSG_NO_MEMORY_PASTE (//)
Not enough memory to paste all of it
MSG_NO_ROOM_COLUMNS (//)
No room: the last columns have something in them
MSG_NO_ROOM_ROWS (//)
No room: the last rows have something in them
MSG_NO_MEMORY_THAT (//)
Not enough memory for that
MSG_NO_MEMORY_FORMAT (//)
Not enough memory to format all of it
MSG_NOTHING_TO_ADD (//)
No numbers above or to the left to add up
MSG_NO_MEMORY_ALL (//)
Not enough memory for all of that
MSG_NO_MEMORY_SORT (//)
Not enough memory to sort all of that
MSG_NO_MEMORY_FILL (//)
Not enough memory to fill all of it
MSG_NOT_FOUND (//)
No cell holds that
